flowchart TD
    Start([AI API call needed]) --> CLI{CLI whoami\nexit 0?}
    CLI -->|yes| UseCLI[Use CLI active session\nno credential injected]
    CLI -->|no| Token{_connections token\nnon-empty?}
    Token -->|yes| UseToken[Inject ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\nor OPENAI_API_KEY as env var]
    Token -->|no| Env{Env var set?\nANTHROPIC_API_KEY /\nOPENAI_API_KEY}
    Env -->|yes| UseEnv[Pass env var to subprocess]
    Env -->|no| Fail([501 Not configured])
    UseCLI --> Spawn[spawn CLI subprocess\nwith allow-listed env]
    UseToken --> Spawn
    UseEnv --> Spawn